    "text": "Laws and Ordinance to be Implemented 1. Formulation of policies, programmes and projects; implementation, monitoring and evaluation in relation to the subject of Digital Infrastructure and Information Technology, and those subjects that come under the purview of Statutory Institutions and Public Corporations listed in Column II",
